                \:
                %em The Randall-Sundrum Model
                (2006) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Maxime-Gabella/publication/239928060_The_Randall-Sundrum_Model/links/588a4037a6fdccb538f1f27f/The-Randall-Sundrum-Model.pdf"}> pdf
