                Tetsuya Shiromizu, Daisuke Ida,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Anti-de Sitter no-hair, AdS/CFT and the brane-world
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0102035"} arXiv:hep-th/0102035
            %li#Padilla02
              %p
                Antonio Padilla,
                %em Braneworld Cosmology and Holography
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/hep-th/0210217"}> arxiv:hep-th/0210217
                )
          %p
            On
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/de+Sitter+spacetime"} de Sitter spacetime
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cosmology"} cosmology
            realized in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/brane+world+models"} brane world models
            in ambient
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo ∼
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \sim
            = succeed "-" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/anti+de+Sitter+spacetime"} AdS
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bulk"} bulk
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/spacetime"} spacetime
          %ul
            %li#BDDGS18
              %p
                Souvik Banerjee,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ulf+Danielsson"} Ulf Danielsson
                %em Emergent de Sitter cosmology from decaying AdS
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1807.01570"}> arXiv:1807.01570
                )
            %li
              %p
                Souvik Banerjee,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ulf+Danielsson"} Ulf Danielsson
                %em de Sitter Cosmology on an expanding bubble
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1907.04268"}> arXiv:1907.04268
                )
          %p More generally on gravity on the brane:
          %ul
            %li
              A. A. Zheltukhin,
              %em Brane mechanism of spontaneously generated gravity
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1912.11520"}> arXiv:1912.11520
              )
          %h3#in_gaugehiggs_grand_unification In gauge-Higgs grand unification
          %p
            RS-like models for
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge-Higgs+unification"} gauge-Higgs
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/grand+unified+theories"} grand unified theories
          %p
            with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spin%2811%29"} Spin(11)
            (“
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SO%2811%29"}> SO(11)
            ”)
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+group"} gauge group
          %ul
            %li#HosotaniYamatsu15
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yutaka+Hosotani"}> Yutaka Hosotani
                , Naoki Yamatsu,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Gauge–Higgs grand unification
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1093/ptep/ptv153"} doi:10.1093/ptep/ptv153
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1093/ptep/ptw116"} doi:10.1093/ptep/ptw116
            %li#FuruiHosotaniYamatsu16
              %p
                Atsushi Furui,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yutaka+Hosotani"} Yutaka Hosotani
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Toward Realistic Gauge-Higgs Grand Unification
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1606.07222"} arXiv:1606.07222
            %li#Hosotani17
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yutaka+Hosotani"}> Yutaka Hosotani
                ,
                %em New dimensions from gauge-Higgs unification
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1702.08161"}> arXiv:1702.08161
                )
            %li#HosotaniYamatsu17
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yutaka+Hosotani"}> Yutaka Hosotani
                , Naoki Yamatsu,
                %em Electroweak Symmetry Breaking and Mass Spectra in Six-Dimensional Gauge-Higgs Grand Unification
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1710.04811"}> arXiv:1710.04811
                )
          %p
            with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Spin%2812%29"} Spin(12)
            (“
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/SO%2812%29"}> SO(12)
            ”)
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+group"} gauge group
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                S. Rajpoot and P. Sithikong,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Implications of the
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi SO
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                          %mn 12
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SO(12)
                    gauge symmetry for grand unification
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevD.23.1649"} doi:10.1103/PhysRevD.23.1649
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Takaaki+Nomura"} Takaaki Nomura
                and Joe Sato,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Standard(-like) Model from an
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mi SO
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                          %mn 12
                          %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} SO(12)
                    Grand Unified Theory in six-dimensions with
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msup
                            %mi S
                            %mn 2
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^2
                    extra-space
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/0810.0898"} arXiv:0810.0898
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Takaaki+Nomura"}> Takaaki Nomura
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    Physics beyond the standard model with
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %msup
                            %mi S
                            %mn 2
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^2
                    extra-space
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://krishna.th.phy.saitama-u.ac.jp/joe/doctor/nomura-doctor.pdf"} pdf
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/NomuraSO12GUT.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
            %li
              %p
                Cheng-Wei Chiang,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Takaaki+Nomura"} Takaaki Nomura
                %em
                  Gauge-Higgs unification models in six dimensions with
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %msup
                          %mi S
                          %mn 2
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                        %msub
                          %mi ℤ
                          %mn 2
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^2/\mathbb{Z}_2
                  extra space and GUT gauge symmetry
                (
                %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1109.5835"}> arXiv:1109.5835
                )
          %h3#observation Observation
          %p Observational hints for brane world models:
          %p
            From observation of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/event+horizon"} event horizon
            of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/black+hole"} black hole
            in the center of the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/galaxy"} galaxy
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Messier+87"} Messier 87
          %ul
            %li
              Indrani Banerjee, Sumanta Chakraborty, Soumitra SenGupta,
              %em
                Silhouette of M87
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msup
                        %mrow
                        %mo *
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} {}^*
                \: A new window to peek into the world of hidden dimensions
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.09385"}> arXiv:1909.09385
              )
          %p
            Form observation of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gravitational+waves"} gravitational waves
            from
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/relativistic+binary"} relativistic binary
            mergers:
          %ul
            %li
              Zi-Chao Lin, Hao Yu, Yu-Xiao Liu,
